    "clusters": "Distinct proper vertex subsets of size at least two, pairwise laminar; the root cluster V is implicit. Every supplied cluster's induced subgraph must be connected.",
    "embedding": "Simple connected planar rotation system with clockwise neighbor rows. Face walks take the next clockwise neighbor after the incoming edge. The directed outer dart identifies the designated outer face.",
    "invalid_input_result": -1
